      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A two-stage low-temperature plasma oxy-nitriding treatment will significantly increase surface hardness relative to untreated titanium alloy.",
